                                                                                          "value":  "CA2 | SENSOR_FLATLINE_CONFIRMED | backend metric reports 10 fresh persisted Node 2 soil-humidity samples are flat | this does not prove HOLD was acknowledged | verify the app action ledger and virtual PLC ACK; no Datadog actuator action; no auto-CLEAR | RECORD=workflow run and linked monitor event | VERIFY=check app action ledger and fresh telemetry before marking recovered; Echo is not recovery proof"
                                                                                      }
